### PFM AI API Tests
### Install VS Code extension: REST Client (humao.rest-client)
### Usage: Click "Send Request" above each block

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ── AUTH ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "password": "Test@1234",
  "monthly_income": 80000
}

###

### 2. Login (copy token from response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=demo@pfm.com&password=Demo@1234

###

### 3. Get Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ── ACCOUNTS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4. Create Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "bank_name": "HDFC Bank",
  "account_token": "HDFC_DEMO_TOKEN_001",
  "account_last4": "1234",
  "account_type": "savings",
  "balance": 150000
}

###

### 5. List Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ── TRANSACTIONS ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6. Add Transaction (Expense)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "account_id": "PASTE_ACCOUNT_ID_HERE",
  "amount": 450,
  "merchant": "Swiggy",
  "description": "Dinner order",
  "transaction_type": "DEBIT",
  "upi_ref": "826012345678",
  "timestamp": "2026-02-20T20:30:00Z"
}

###

### 7. Add Income
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "account_id": "PASTE_ACCOUNT_ID_HERE",
  "amount": 75000,
  "merchant": "Company Salary",
  "description": "February Salary",
  "transaction_type": "CREDIT",
  "timestamp": "2026-02-01T09:00:00Z"
}

###

### 8. Get All Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 9. Monthly Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/summary/monthly?month=2&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ── BUDGETS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 10. Set Budget
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budgets/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "category": "Food & Dining",
  "limit_amount": 8000
}

###

### 11. AI Budget Recommendations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budgets/recommend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 12. Savings Simulation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budgets/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "current_savings": 20000,
  "monthly_extra": 5000,
  "goal": 100000
}

###

### ── GOALS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 13. Create Goal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/goals/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "goal_name": "Goa Vacation",
  "target_amount": 50000,
  "monthly_contribution": 5000
}

###

### ── AI FEATURES ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### 14. Get Forecast
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forecast/?periods=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 15. Chat with AI
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "How much did I spend on food this month?"
}

###

### ── DASHBOARD ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 16. Full Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ── WEBHOOK (Bank Simulation) ───────────────────────────────

### 17. Simulate incoming webhook
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhook/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "txn_id": "UPI20260220001",
  "amount": 350,
  "merchant": "Zomato",
  "timestamp": "2026-02-20T14:30:00Z",
  "account_token": "HDFC_DEMO_TOKEN_001",
  "type": "DEBIT",
  "upi_ref": "826099887766",
  "description": "Food delivery"
}

###

### 18. Alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

